//				(literally: flowers in the mirror, affinity / relation)
//			Second choice for localized name:
//				镜花园 (literally: flowers in the mirror, garden)
//			镜花缘 and 镜花园 are homonyms.
//			The former has deeper cultural roots -- it's the name
//			of a classic book -- and Clara preferred it for that reason.
//			The latter, with the notion of "garden" included, would have
//			brought out the notion of repetition more explicitly.
